{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"852739507647545364","content":"Gungnir (Identified) Quest Weapon.\n2 handed finesse weapon with 10 foot reach. Melee or Thrown.\nMelee- +1 to hit On hit 2d6+4 and 1d6 fire damage..\nThrown - 2d4+4- auto hit. Thrown: Odin's spear does not miss. Range: 30.\nThrone of Valhalla:\nProve your self in combat against a Valkyrie and Valhalla will come when you call.\nOnce complete, summon 2d4+2 Berserkers to fight for on your behalf for a single battle. Usable once per 7 days.\nRequires attunement by 2 priests or priestess of an Aesir or aspect of an Aesir.\n\nThis weapon is carved of Yggdrasil itself. \nDeclaring any foe defeated as a sacrifice to an Aesir or aspect of an Aesir shall deliver it unto them.\n\nFor 9 days did Odin hang upon this spear, pinned to Yggdrasil. Upon awakening, the gift of the runic language was given unto him.","created_at":"2021-07-26T06:23:21.014000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869102574953959464","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
